// Bun Snapshot v1, https://bun.sh/docs/test/snapshots

exports[`repro815: board independence before and after KiCad export 1`] = `
"Issue #815: separate boards must not need connections to each other.
KiCad merges nets with the same name, even if their numeric IDs differ.

CIRCUIT JSON INPUT
Boards: 9
Independent R1.pin2 -> C1.pin1 connections: 9
Each connection is already routed within its own board.

EXPORTED KICAD NETS
Numeric ID | Net name
1 | pcb_board_0{slash}Net-(R1-Pad2)
2 | pcb_board_1{slash}Net-(R1-Pad2)__1
3 | pcb_board_2{slash}Net-(R1-Pad2)__2
4 | pcb_board_3{slash}Net-(R1-Pad2)__3
5 | pcb_board_4{slash}Net-(R1-Pad2)__4
6 | pcb_board_5{slash}Net-(R1-Pad2)__5
7 | pcb_board_6{slash}Net-(R1-Pad2)__6
8 | pcb_board_7{slash}Net-(R1-Pad2)__7
9 | pcb_board_8{slash}Net-(R1-Pad2)__8

EXPECTED VS ACTUAL
Unique net names: expected 9, actual 9
Native KiCad DRC missing connections: expected 0, actual 0

PASS: KiCad does not request connections between the independent boards."
`;
